      "length": 1,
      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "F0098",
      "start": 10252,
      "length": 233,
      "text": "- The baseline runs were produced on 2026-11-03; candidate runs were produced on 2026-11-04. The source, all prompts, commit, model alias, and workflow settings matched, but the model provider may change the backend behind an alias.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "F0099",
      "start": 10485,
      "length": 139,
      "text": "- No seed or temperature override was available. Three runs per condition show consistency in these samples, not statistical significance.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "F0100",
      "start": 10624,
      "length": 150,
      "text": "- Idea and Research outputs vary between runs. This is expected in the same full-pipeline comparison; all other stages and inputs were kept constant.\n"
    },
    {
